Labnet consensus parameters for Bitcoin Knots v29.4.knots20260508, in the
mainnet section. They are the same as for the Bitcoin Core node in core/patches/.

SegWit and Taproot are active from the genesis block. The chain has a single
small miner, so the difficulty is never retargeted, and there is no minimum
chain work or assumed-valid block. powLimit stays at the mainnet value, so the
difficulty never drops below 1.

